{"action":"edited","number":2,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dpaezRC/fast-api-template/pulls/2","id":2788025650,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPm-cqc6mLeUy","html_url":"https://github.com/dpaezRC/fast-api-template/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/dpaezRC/fast-api-template/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dpaezRC/fast-api-template/pull/2.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dpaezRC/fast-api-template/issues/2","number":2,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(FAT-02): modularize","user":{"login":"dpaezRC","id":158207092,"node_id":"U_kgDOCW4MdA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158207092?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC","html_url":"https://github.com/dpaezRC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This pull request introduces the initial setup for a FastAPI-based backend with MongoDB integration, including configuration, database models, API routes, and development tooling. The main themes are backend infrastructure setup, product API implementation, and development workflow enhancements.\r\n\r\n**Backend Infrastructure Setup:**\r\n\r\n* Added `docker-compose.yml` to provide a MongoDB service for local development, making it easier to spin up the required database environment.\r\n* Implemented configuration loading in `src/config.py` using environment variables and dotenv for flexible database connection management.\r\n* Added asynchronous database connection logic with Beanie ODM in `src/database.py` for MongoDB initialization.\r\n* Set up FastAPI application lifecycle management in `src/main.py`, including database initialization and router registration.\r\n\r\n**Product API Implementation:**\r\n\r\n* Defined `Product` and `Category` models in `src/models/Product.py` using Beanie and Pydantic, including indexing for efficient queries.\r\n* Created comprehensive CRUD endpoints for products in `src/routes/api/products.py`, supporting listing, retrieval, creation, update (full and partial), and deletion, with robust error handling.\r\n\r\n**Development Workflow Enhancements:**\r\n\r\n* Added a GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/lint.yml`) to run Ruff linter on pull requests, ensuring code quality.\r\n* Configured Ruff linter rules in `pyproject.toml` to enforce specific code standards and ignore line length warnings.\r\n\r\n**API Healthcheck:**\r\n\r\n* Refactored healthcheck endpoint into `src/routes/api/healthcheck.py` for modularity and clarity in API structure.\r\n","created_at":"2025-08-31T20:03:30Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T17:00:11Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"5e36f3937dd11bc9d1f3a4aa851f1e3f8ccc16d7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":9197218580,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPm-cqc8AAAACJDJrFA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dpaezRC/fast-api-template/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":9197218582,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPm-cqc8AAAACJDJrFg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dpaezRC/fast-api-template/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Improvements or additions to documentation"},{"id":9197218584,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPm-cqc8AAAACJDJrGA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dpaezRC/fast-api-template/labe