/database.py` for MongoDB initialization.\r\n* Set up FastAPI application lifecycle management in `src/main.py`, including database initialization and router registration.\r\n\r\n**Product API Implementation:**\r\n\r\n* Defined `Product` and `Category` models in `src/models/Product.py` using Beanie and Pydantic, including indexing for efficient queries.\r\n* Created comprehensive CRUD endpoints for products in `src/routes/api/products.py`, supporting listing, retrieval, creation, update (full and partial), and deletion, with robust error handling.\r\n\r\n**Development Workflow Enhancements:**\r\n\r\n* Added a GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/lint.yml`) to run Ruff linter on pull requests, ensuring code quality.\r\n* Configured Ruff linter rules in `pyproject.toml` to enforce specific code standards and ignore line length warnings.\r\n\r\n**API Healthcheck:**\r\n\r\n* Refactored healthcheck endpoint into `src/routes/api/healthcheck.py` for modularity and clarity in API structure."}},"repository":{"id":1047501993,"node_id":"R_kgDOPm-cqQ","name":"fast-api-template","full_name":"dpaezRC/fast-api-template","private":false,"owner":{"login":"dpaezRC","id":158207092,"node_id":"U_kgDOCW4MdA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158207092?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC","html_url":"https://github.com/dpaezRC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpaezRC/receive